<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h8a3d0e04g1001g458fgbd13g99c3c38840d3" version="1">临死反击</content>
	<content contentuid="h665dfee3g5733g4d4bgb009g362108d73601" version="1">还没轮到行动就倒下的小首领在死时进行了反击：[1]。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb433e428gb9afg46b9gbbb2g5a63a05e7308" version="1">被追猎</content>
	<content contentuid="h73ef1b08g3048g4530g9f9bg2290cbd98f95" version="1">追猎者选中了你。无论你站在哪里,它的伏击都会在你周围出现,只有杀死它才能解除。</content>
